{"id":"vod_sn_150063","vodId":"150063","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"穹庐下的魔女","name_cn":"穹庐下的魔女","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260705-1/3770414286462f5404117baeef3936c3.jpg"},"summary":"十三世纪，幼小的奴隶希塔拉在伊朗东部城市图斯被奴隶商委托给一个学者辈出的家族进行教育。希塔拉起初试图逃跑，但她被教导了知识的重要性，希塔拉在这里被女主人法蒂玛视为女儿般的宠爱，并学习了欧几里得的《几何原本》等诸多知识。家族的继承人穆罕默德为了研究学问而前往内沙布尔后 8 年，图斯遭到蒙古人的袭击。希塔拉被拖雷的军队俘虏，法蒂玛为了保护希塔拉而被杀害。此外，《几何原本》也被抢走了。被带到蒙古的希塔拉开始思考对蒙古的复仇。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-13 08:42:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/05/J47FVt2b7Q27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/05/4bSUcdwpsL27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/12/rG9fNnDmqr27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/19/vYR6DCc0AQ27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/26/UE3XJZ1PP227/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/02/7FZiVxYfTk27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/09/W4VvGGHKPW27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/16/5wPcV3NHPM27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/23/Ec0AEdCZi727/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/30/fT1Nskcr8N27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202609/06/y3zyXe6QhV27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202609/13/z647CYJLHM27/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:36.345Z"}